---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { content } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { altsFor } from '../../i18n/utils';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const t = content[lang];
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title={`${t.footer.cookies}, Ideasforge`}
  description="What cookies the Ideasforge site uses, what each one is for and what choices you have about them."
  alternates={altsFor('cookies')}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">{t.footer.cookies}</h1>

    <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:text-fg prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-accent prose-strong:text-fg">
      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small data files that are placed on your device when you visit a website.
        Cookies are widely used by website owners to make their websites work, or to work more
        efficiently, as well as to provide reporting information.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies We Use</h2>
      <p>
        We use both first-party and third-party cookies on our website. Cookies set by us are
        called "first-party cookies." Cookies set by third parties, such as Google, are called
        "third-party cookies." These third-party cookies enable features or functionality (such as
        analytics and advertising) to be provided on or through our website.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>This site sets no analytics or advertising cookies today.</strong> We do not use
        Google Analytics or any equivalent, so there is nothing here for you to accept or refuse.
        If we ever measure visits, it will be with a system that stores no cookies and identifies
        nobody, and this page will say so before it happens.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Your Choices About Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to decide whether to accept or reject cookies. You can exercise your
        cookie preferences by adjusting the settings in your browser. If you choose to reject
        cookies, you can still use our website, but your access to some functionality and areas of
        the site may be restricted.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Changes to This Cookies Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Cookies Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or
        for other operational, legal or regulatory reasons. Please review this policy periodically
        to stay informed about how we are using cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about the use of cookies or other technologies, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        Ideasforge<br />
        Website: <a href="https://www.ideasforge.io">www.ideasforge.io</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
